          "dcterms:date": "2026-09-30",
          "adms:versionNotes": "WS-1 VOCABULARY CONSOLIDATION, lot 1i. owl:imports written as plain strings (JSON-LD literals: no reasoner followed them, so this file was reasoned in isolation and the apex declarations of M3_GrammarFoundation were invisible to it) rewritten as IRIs {\"@id\": ...}: 4 import(s). Target = the imported file's document URL, resolved by @base (Michel, 2026-09-30: aligning ontology IRIs with document URLs is recorded as a later lot). Triage: ontology/docs/_01_Worksite/WS-1/WS-1_FamilyA_Triage.md."
        },
        {
          "owl:versionInfo": "1.1.0",
          "dcterms:date": "2026-09-30",
          "adms:versionNotes": "WS-1 VOCABULARY CONSOLIDATION, lot 1e. Changelog container m2:changelog -> m3:changelog (the owl:AnnotationProperty declared in M3_GrammarFoundation); entry keys version/date/changes -> owl:versionInfo / dcterms:date / adms:versionNotes (ADMS accepted, Michel 2026-09-30); prefix adms declared. Previously the whole changelog was dropped on JSON-LD expansion."
        },
        {
          "owl:versionInfo": "1.0.0",
          "dcterms:date": "2026-03-06",
          "adms:versionNotes": "Initial TscgTool ontology for tscg_poclet_generator.py — dogfooding instance. ASFID/REVOI analysis, 8-component architecture, 8 GenericConcepts mobilized. GenesisSpace → GenesisGrammar migration."
        }
